  (text "RPi HQ Camera (15P 1.0mm)  ->  Radxa Rock 5B+ CAM0 (31P 0.3mm)  flex adapter\nJ1 = 31P gold fingers (Rock CAM0)      J2 = 15P gold fingers (camera)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "31c72380-60dd-464d-97ca-bbc0b70d0a6c"))
  (text "NOTE (a): U1 OE is pulled UP to VCCA via R1 (10k). This deviates from the TXS0104E\ndatasheet's recommended pulldown: there is no controller on this cable to drive OE,\nand always-enabled operation is intended." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1483acf-fd89-45e3-9b29-0192be1219bf"))
  (text "NOTE (b): J1 pins 30/31 (VCC_5V) are INTENTIONALLY UNCONNECTED.\n5V must never reach the camera (3.3V max)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c17996df-684c-44a2-96cf-1d807b6b21fb"))
  (text "NOTE (c): Gold-finger pad dimensions are PLACEHOLDERS pending receptacle\ndatasheet verification (see tools/generate_fingers.py)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21569a2d-6b84-4200-8ecf-2293562fa3e3"))
  (text "NOTE (d): TXS0104E constraint: VCCA (1.8V, Rock side) MUST be <= VCCB (3.3V,\ncamera side). U2 (XC6206-1.8) derives VCCA from VCC_3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 88.90 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "76a4796b-5619-44b6-8b9b-57b4624e6906"))
  (text "Translator channels: 1=SCL  2=SDA  3=CAM_EN  4=XVS spare (TP1/TP2).\nR2-R4 are 0R insurance footprints in SCL/SDA/CAM_EN.\nJP1 (open) breaks out J1.27 CM_RST_L_1 to TP3 for future reset experiments." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "347c8129-2f84-46de-8fed-5e4a8652387e"))
